  <section id="iletisim" class="contact-section">
    <div class="shell contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-copy reveal"><h2>Benimle<br><em>iletişime</em><br>geçin.</h2><p>İlk adımı atmak için formu doldurun. Uygun bir görüşme zamanı belirlemek üzere size dönüş yapalım.</p><dl><div><svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg><span><dt>E-posta</dt><dd><a href="mailto:iletisim@selinunal.com">iletisim@selinunal.com</a></dd></span></div><div><svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5"/><rect x="2" y="6" width="14" height="12" rx="2"/></svg><span><dt>Görüşme</dt><dd>Karabük’te yüz yüze, Türkiye genelinde online</dd></span></div></dl><div class="social-links" aria-label="Sosyal medya bağlantıları"><a href="#" data-social="instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Instagram" hidden><svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg></a><a href="#" data-social="linkedin" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn" hidden><svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg></a><a href="#" data-social="whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="WhatsApp" hidden><svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg></a></div></div>
      <form class="contact-form reveal" data-contact-form>
        <label>Ad Soyad *<input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Adınız Soyadınız" required></label>
        <label>E-posta *<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="eposta@ornek.com" required></label>
        <label>Telefon<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="05xx xxx xx xx"></label>
        <label>Görüşme Tercihi<select name="preference"><option value="">Seçin…</option><option>Online</option><option>Yüz yüze</option></select></label>
        <label class="form-wide">Başvuru Konusu<input name="subject" type="text" placeholder="Örn: kaygı, ilişki sorunları…"></label>
        <label class="form-wide">Mesajınız *<textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Kendinizden ve beklentilerinizden kısaca bahsedebilirsiniz…" required></textarea></label>
        <label class="form-consent form-wide"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" value="evet" required><span><a href="kvkk.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aydınlatma Metni</a>’ni okudum; iletişim bilgilerimin ve paylaştığım bilgilerin randevu talebimin değerlendirilmesi amacıyla işlenmesine açık rıza veriyorum. *</span></label>
        <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" class="sr-only">
        <button class="form-submit form-wide" type="submit">Gönder <svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"/><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"/></svg></button>
        <p class="form-note form-wide">Bilgileriniz yalnızca randevu talebinizin değerlendirilmesi amacıyla kullanılır, üçüncü kişilerle paylaşılmaz.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
